      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;abstract&#34;&gt;Abstract&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We present a novel deep learning approach for predicting protein structures using transformer architectures. Our method achieves state-of-the-art results on benchmark datasets and demonstrates improved accuracy over existing methods.&lt;/p&gt;
